# HesabYar Cursor Rules

Full project rules: see CURSOR_RULES.md

## Always
- TypeScript strict, no `any`
- Shared Zod schemas in `packages/shared` for every API payload
- RTL + Vazirmatn + Jalali dates + fa-IR money formatting
- PrimeVue only for inputs/tables
- Accounting equation must balance on every voucher commit
- One phase at a time; tests green before phase complete
- Ask approval before next phase

## Monorepo
- `apps/desktop` — Tauri + Vue
- `apps/server` — NestJS
- `packages/shared` — Zod schemas

## After each phase
1. `pnpm test`
2. Smoke `pnpm dev`
3. `chore(phase-N): ...` commit
4. Wait for user approval
